style="line-height:6.0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:2pt;border-bottom:1.00pt solid #000000;width:21%;text-align:center;margin-left: auto;margin-right: auto">&#160;</div></div> <p style="margin-top:8pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:18pt; font-family:Times New Roman;font-weight:bold;text-align:center">FORM <ix:nonNumeric name="dei:DocumentType" contextRef="duration_2026-01-26_to_2026-01-26" id="ixv-275">8-K</ix:nonNumeric></p> <p style="font-size:8pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</p> <div style="text-align:center"> <div style="line-height:6.0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:2pt;border-bottom:1.00pt solid #000000;width:21%;text-align:center;margin-left: auto;margin-right: auto">&#160;</div></div> <p style="margin-top:8pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:12pt; font-family:Times New Roman;font-weight:bold;text-align:center">CURRENT REPORT</p> <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:12pt; font-family:Times New Roman;font-weight:bold;text-align:center">Pursuant to Section&#160;13 or 15(d) of</p> <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:12pt; font-family:Times New Roman;font-weight:bold;text-align:center">The Securities Exchange Act of 1934</p> <p style="margin-top:8pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:12pt; font-family:Times New Roman;font-weight:bold;text-align:center">Date of Report (Date of earliest event reported)</p> <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:12pt; font-family:Times New Roman;font-weight:bold;text-align:center"><ix:nonNumeric name="dei:DocumentPeriodEndDate" contextRef="duration_2026-01-26_to_2026-01-26" format="ixt:datemonthdayyearen" id="ixv-276">January&#160;26, 2026</ix:nonNumeric></p> <p style="font-size:8pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</p> <div style="text-align:center"> <div style="line-height:6.0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:2pt;border-bottom:1.00pt solid #000000;width:21%;text-align:center;margin-left: auto;margin-right: auto">&#160;</div></div> <p style="margin-top:8pt; margin-botto